    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>Some couriers walk; some dream their routes.</em></p><p>While you are <strong>asleep or in a dream state</strong> (magical or mundane), you may send <strong>short messages</strong> (up to 12 words) to up to <strong>tier allies</strong> who are:</p><ul><li>In Hexes <strong>adjacent</strong> to your own, and</li><li>Marked as <strong>Gate Anchors</strong> by you at any previous time.</li></ul><p>Allies receive these messages as sudden waking impressions or dream-echoes. They may send one brief reply (12 words) which you hear as though whispered across a hallway of light.</p>",
